  "material_proposed_consequences": [
    "Explicit parent in new B/C, versioned canonical/schema/hash domains; no old object relabelling",
    "ISC Vote v2 removes signature_id from exact signable bytes; detached artifact owns its identity",
    "FR-003: persist kind-2 exact Vote intent and barrier before signing; retained signature/source artifacts durable before exposure",
    "Inline complete W1 delivery evidence, with explicit new per-actor round event/byte admission domain",
    "Production model budget accounting changes Init/Next guards and liveness premises; no unchanged-model claim",
    "Full original source/other-certificate authentication remains required, not proved by ISC signatures"
  ],
